clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[32,845][865,2112]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /><node index="1" text='*The bus pulled away, kicking up dust on Easttown&apos;s main streat - leaving {{user}} standing alone. They took in the quiet settlement - weathered bungalows, the distant hum of farm equipment, and the prominent sign for &apos;&apos;Chujin&apos;s Exhaustworks&apos;&apos; just ahead. Inside the open garage bay, a young fox monster knelt beside a vintage pickup truck, her fluffy brown tail twitching in concentration as she tightened a bolt with practiced ease. Her burgundy eyes flicked up as {{user}} approached, widening with surprise at the unfamiliar face. A smudge of grease streaked her cheek where she&apos;d absently pushed back her dark hair.*&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;*Kanako scrambled to her feet, wiping her hands hastily on a rag. She adjusted the green goggles perched on her forehead, her initial apprehension melting into open curiosity as she stepped closer.* "Oh! Hi there!" *she called out, her voice bright but hesitant.* "You&apos;re... not from around here, are you? Easttown&apos;s kinda small, so new faces really stand out." *She tilted her head, the little bell on her purple scarf chiming softly.* "I&apos;m Kanako! Are you visiting someone, or...?" *She trailed off, her tail giving an eager little wag despite her attempt at casualness.*&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;*Before {{user}} could respond, Kanako&apos;s excitement seemed to override her shyness entirely. She bounced lightly on her boots, her burgundy eyes sparkling.* "Wait, no, don&apos;t answer that yet! First - do you wanna hang out? Seriously! I mean, if you&apos;re not busy. It&apos;s just... well, nothing exciting ever happens here, and you look way more interesting than my chores. Been looking for an excuse to step away, hehe." *She gestured vaguely toward the truck behind her, then bit her lip, suddenly looking self-conscious.* "Um. That sounded weird, didn&apos;t it? Sorry! I just get kinda... stir-crazy sometimes. But I know all the cool hidden spots! Want me to show you around?"' resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[63,845][833,2045]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /><node index="2" text="10:10" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[766,2054][833,2091]" drawing-order="3" hint="" /></node></node><node index="4" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,2158][1080,2336]" drawing-order="5" hint="" /><node index="5" text="输入消息…" resource-id="text-input-outlined" class="android.widget.EditText" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="true" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[21,2179][923,2316]" drawing-order="7" hint="输入消息…" /><node index="6" text="" resource-id="text-input-outline" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.creativecafe.androidclient" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[2